comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-20T04:53:16.013Z","harness:codex","Implementation start 2026-08-20: selected after complete all-status live orientation across 2,525 items, full metadata/history/relationship review of this canonical lineage, and GitHub/release/security/dependency verification. This item owns the public SDK preflight primitive and migration of all 50 current literal checks across 45 files; the same branch will execute its three recovery states and add a source-derived replication ratchet."
  "2026-08-20T06:14:24.553Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence 2026-08-20: centralized all 50 current initialized-tracker checks across 45 SDK modules behind the public shared preflight; missing root, empty root, and regular-file root now emit distinct typed codes and safe tokenized recovery. The executable refusal corpus expanded 18 -> 21 and passes 21/21; the source ratchet reports 50 required occurrences and zero forbidden legacy literals. Full repository proof passes 537/537 files and 7,634/7,634 tests at exact 55,749/55,749 statements, 41,582/41,582 branches, 11,567/11,567 functions, and 53,789/53,789 lines. ESLint and jscpd passed; package artifact gate passed (1,449 files); isolated packed npm consumer recovered missing/empty roots, safely refused a file root, imported SDK contracts, and passed local npx/bunx. Secret scan, production audit (0 vulnerabilities), and Trivy high/critical vuln+secret+misconfiguration scan passed."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-20T06:14:25.217Z","harness:codex","Tracker initialization is a filesystem state machine, not one missing-file boolean: preserving root-missing, non-directory, settings-missing, and readable-root states in one SDK primitive prevents unsafe recovery advice and lets executable assurance measure every transition."
